The revision binds each allow to the original resolved address and corrects the ShiBi contract. I found two likely blockers in the new mechanics: retirement excludes the first id minted after the base counter, and the answer recheck can repeatedly scan irrelevant answers without reaching a valid answer behind them. I’m checking those against the stream cursor behavior and rollback paths.
